---
// Anglická verze zásad zpracování osobních údajů (protějšek /cs/gdpr).
// Slug je záměrně stejný jako v CS — hreflang dělá jen záměnu prefixu,
// odlišný slug by ho rozbil (viz AE-8 u blogu).
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy notice"
  description="How aethero processes personal data on this website and in the Shoptet to Shopify converter."
  lang="en"
>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="hero-blob" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <h1>Personal data <br />processing notice</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- OBSAH -->
  <section class="section bg-primary">
    <div class="container legal-body">
      <p>
        The controller of your personal data is AETHERO s.r.o., company ID
        05288762, registered at Kurzova 2222/16, 155 00 Prague 5, Czech Republic.
        Contact: <a href="mailto:info@aethero.cz">info@aethero.cz</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        We only process data you provide to us yourself, and only for the
        purposes described below.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h3">What data we process and why</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Enquiries and contact forms</strong> — when you contact us, we
        process your name, e-mail, phone number and the content of your message
        in order to handle your enquiry (the legal basis is pre-contractual
        negotiation). We keep the data for the duration of the negotiation and
        for 3&nbsp;years afterwards.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Shoptet → Shopify converter</strong> — your product data file is
        processed directly in your browser. We store the generated CSV on secure
        storage only so that we can give you a download link — it is deleted
        automatically after 7&nbsp;days. The e-mail address you enter in the form
        is used to send you the download link and, based on your consent, to send
        occasional news about e-commerce and Shopify. You can withdraw your
        consent at any time — via the unsubscribe link in every e-mail or by
        writing to <a href="mailto:info@aethero.cz">info@aethero.cz</a>. We keep
        the e-mail until consent is withdrawn.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Operational data</strong> — using the website and our tools
        creates technical records (IP address, request time). We use them solely
        to secure and operate our services (legitimate interest) and keep them
        only for a short time.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h3">Who we share data with</h2>
      <p>
        We never sell your data, nor pass it on for third-party marketing. We
        only use vetted suppliers with whom we have data processing agreements
        in place, in the following categories:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>hosting and content delivery providers (running the website and its tools),</li>
        <li>temporary file storage providers (the converter download link),</li>
        <li>e-mail and communication service providers,</li>
        <li>newsletter delivery providers.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Some of them may process data outside the European Union. In that case
        the transfer is always covered by appropriate safeguards under the GDPR —
        standard contractual clauses or the EU-U.S. Data Privacy Framework.
      </p>
      <p>
        We will gladly provide the current list of specific processors on request
        at <a href="mailto:info@aethero.cz">info@aethero.cz</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h3">Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Technical cookies necessary for running the website are stored without
        consent — the site would not work without them. <strong>Analytics cookies
        are stored only after you give us your consent</strong> in the cookie
        bar; until then no measurement tool is loaded at all.
      </p>
      <p>
        We use analytics only to learn which pages are useful and what to fix on
        the site. We do not link the data to your identity and we do not use it
        for advertising.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can change your choice at any time via the
        <strong>Cookie settings</strong> link in the website footer. The
        Shoptet → Shopify converter stores no cookies of its own.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h3">Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You have the right to access your data, to have it corrected or erased,
        to restrict processing, to data portability and to object. You can
        withdraw any consent at any time. You may lodge a complaint with the
        Czech Office for Personal Data Protection
        (<a href="https://www.uoou.gov.cz" target="_blank" rel="noopener">www.uoou.gov.cz</a>).
        To exercise your rights write to
        <a href="mailto:info@aethero.cz">info@aethero.cz</a> — we will reply
        within 30&nbsp;days at the latest.
      </p>

      <p class="legal-effective">This notice is effective from 1&nbsp;January&nbsp;2026.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

</PageLayout>

<style>
  /* ── Hero ── */
  .legal-hero {
    position: relative;
    padding: 130px 0 80px;
    background: var(--ae-bg-primary);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-blob {
    position: absolute;
    top: -20%;
    right: -5%;
    width: 600px;
    height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(80, 20, 160, 0.4) 0%, transparent 70%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(90px);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .hero-inner h1 {
    font-size: var(--fs-70);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.08;
  }

  /* ── Tělo dokumentu ── */
  .section {
    padding: var(--space-64) 0 var(--space-120);
  }
  .legal-body {
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  .legal-body h2 {
    margin: var(--space-64) 0 var(--space-24);
  }
  .legal-body p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-24);
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
  }
  .legal-body ul {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-24);
    padding-left: 22px;
  }
  .legal-body li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
  }
  .legal-body a {
    color: var(--action);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .legal-effective {
    margin-top: var(--space-64);
    font-size: var(--fs-16);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .legal-hero {
      padding: 100px 0 50px;
    }
  }
</style>
